Description: key-rotating reverse proxy for the Ollama Cloud API
 ollamux gives several Ollama Cloud API keys and serves them combined
 behind one local endpoint. Requests are spread across keys
 (round-robin, least-loaded first), and when a key is rate-limited,
 rejected, or invalid, the request silently retries on the next key
 before anything reaches the client.
 .
 This is not a local Ollama server: it serves no models, it proxies to
 https://ollama.com. Point Ollama clients at it via
 OLLAMA_HOST=http://localhost:11435, or OpenAI-compatible clients via
 base URL http://localhost:11435/v1.